  StyleBox[
   RowBox[{"SchurDimension", "::", "notpar"}], "MR"]], "InlineFormula",
  ExpressionUUID->"ef9881ad-e1c8-41ea-b9e0-bbb5ecabc9b6"],
 " when given anything other than an integer partition (a list of weakly \
decreasing positive integers) or a ",
